ots of depth. Access unlimited community-made rollercoasters in Online Sharing.   \n\nADDITIONAL FEATURES: \n- Terrain editor. \n- Decorate the environment with trees, rocks, and other props.", "short_description": "CoasterMania is a physics-based VR rollercoaster game where you create the ride of your life! Use wacky contraptions and elements to fly through the sky, then experience your creation by jumping in the front seat. \n  "}]}, "developer_name": "Stephen Rogers", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://stephenrogers6.wixsite.com/coastermania/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "4th Wall Breakers", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.coastermaniavr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1725996564472128"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1111892749745810"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 12, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "932992452543758"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "771859168786907"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4091311991134718"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "769518238967637"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1264212938606121"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1788158631735283"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1820848298666450"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1661769904722403"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2509796049216408"}, {"status": "PUBLIS